			"notes": "### Features\n- **rejoin** (beta, off by default): when SkyBlock throws you into a Hypixel lobby or limbo while you stay connected, the mod waits 1:10 and sends `/play skyblock` once. From limbo it sends `/lobby` first. A chat line only you see announces it; `/jsb cancel` stops it. It never sends `/is` or anything else\n- **rejoin**: the kick is noticed either by the hypixel-mod-api location going from SkyBlock to a lobby, or by Hypixel's own kick line in chat (\"An exception occurred in your connection...\"), which also covers limbo\n- **rejoin**: leaving on purpose (`/lobby`, `/l`, `/play <game>`, `/limbo`...) is not a kick; getting back to SkyBlock yourself or being warped into a game cancels the countdown\n\n### Fixes\n- **connect**: the SkyBlock lobby was taken for SkyBlock itself, so the menu button could skip `/play skyblock` after landing there\n\n### Good to know\n- Turn it on in the Mod Menu settings or with `rejoinSkyblock` in `config/joinskyblock.json`; `rejoinDelaySeconds` sets the wait (70 by default)\n- The rejoin needs `hypixel-mod-api`; without it the option does nothing\n\n**Full changelog**: https://github.com/soldey/JoinSkyBlock/compare/v1.0.1...v1.1.0"
		},
